  "title": "Grandma&#39;s Favorite Chicken",
  "description": "My Grandma used to make this chicken and it was my mom&#39;s favorite. It is very easy, quick, flexible, and delicious. You may add as many different veggies and any amount you want. The broth made from this is great to dip bread and butter; my brother loves to have it as soup. Yum!!!",
